                  Parameters for GAMV
                  *******************

START OF PARAMETERS:
multivariate.dat   \file with data
1 2 3   \columns for X, Y, Z coordinates
2 4 5   \number of variables, column numbers
-998.0 1e21   \trimming limits
gamv.out   \file for variogram output
5   \number of lags
4   \lag separation distance
2   \lag tolerance
1   \number of directions
0.0 90.0 1.0e21 0.0 90.0 1.0e21   \azm,atol,bandh,dip,dtol,bandv
0   \standardize sills? (0=no, 1=yes)
2   \number of variograms
1 1 9 4.0   \tail var., head var., variogram type
2 2 1   \tail var., head var., variogram type
